  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mongolia: Strengthening Commercial Mediation in Mongolia: Legal Assistance on the Revision of Mediation Law and Promotion of Commercial Mediation to SMEs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To support the development of a policy and legislative analysis and recommendations. 2) To further capacity development of mediators. 3) To promote commercial mediation to small and medium-sized entreprises.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiaries: Judges, lawyers and mediators, and small and medium-sized enterprises. Indirect beneficiaries: Business community at large.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed to assist the Government of Mongolia in improving the regulatory environment, institutional setting and practice of mediation in Mongolia, and promoting and facilitating the use of commercial mediation on a national scale with a particular focus on creating enabling environment for online mediation.</narrative>
  </description>
